<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears rise in January.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from the federal or regional governments rose to 9.48 trillion roubles in January from 9.28 trillion roubles in December, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		Jan 27     Dec 23</p>
<p>    wage arrears (government)	  9,482	9,280</p>
<p>    wage arrears (companies)	  39,120     37,871</p>
<p>    wage arrears (total)		48,602     47,151</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
